/*
  JobProgressDrawer.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0005 · JobProgressDrawer (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `JobProgressDrawer` resolves (table "JobProgressDrawer") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (components/feedback/JobProgressDrawer.tsx). The second + third groups are the export type /
  status catalogs the web `prettyType` / `prettyStatus` map. The fourth group backs the native
  chrome (relative-time buckets, P4 freshness / loading / empty / error copy, VoiceOver-only
  labels) so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

